      "content": "thanks for the advice. i'm starting to see how they're doing it... like, the payroll delay was timed exactly when i was expecting my bonus, and the menu change happens every time i'm working late. it feels like they're watching my every move to find the exact points where i'll snap. if i can prove this is a systematic attempt to force me out, what kind of specific 'intent' should i be looking for in their communications? i want to catch them in the act of making this happen on purpose.",
